        "source_solution": "Frozen source-solutions.md: horizontal graph readings at y=1.2,1.7,2.5 yield x approximately 1.4,2.9,6.3. The exact algebraic reference coordinates are 1.44,2.89,6.25 from x=y^2; they are not asserted to be exact graph readings.",
